{
  "id": 133255592,
  "iid": 5670,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "dfilter: Use ISO8601 as the default time format",
  "description": "Change from a default custom time representation to ISO8601.\nAll the existing formats are still supported for backward-\ncompatibility.\n\nBefore:\n\n    Filter: frame.time == \"2011-07-04 12:34:56\"\n\n    Constants:\n    00000 PUT_FVALUE\t\"Jul  4, 2011 12:34:56.000000000\" <FT_ABSOLUTE_TIME> -> reg#1\n    (...)\n\nAfter:\n\n    Filter: frame.time == \"2011-07-04 12:34:56\"\n\n    Constants:\n    00000 PUT_FVALUE\t\"2011-07-04 12:34:56+0100\" <FT_ABSOLUTE_TIME> -> reg#1\n    (...)",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-12-30T22:23:14.544Z",
