        {
          "id": 798986208,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "That would do it, but it's pretty common to see the T omitted in protocols that use the basic format (by agreement, according to ISO 8601.) ASN.1 GeneralizedTime omits the T, for example. So we could have another format option in the enum (require T vs not requiring it), that's an option instead of requiring separators in filter.",
