        "e8e6a2c6df5ffaf983bdc8b4ccb88c340df8b6cf"
      ],
      "title": "dfilter: Use ISO8601 as the default time format",
      "message": "dfilter: Use ISO8601 as the default time format\n\nChange from a default custom time representation to ISO8601.\nAll the existing formats are still supported for backward-\ncompatibility.\n\nBefore:\n\n  Filter: frame.time == \"2011-07-04 12:34:56\"\n\n  Constants:\n  00000 PUT_FVALUE\t\"Jul  4, 2011 12:34:56.000000000\" <FT_ABSOLUTE_TIME> -> reg#1\n  (...)\n\nAfter:\n\n  Filter: frame.time == \"2011-07-04 12:34:56\"\n\n  Constants:\n  00000 PUT_FVALUE\t\"2011-07-04 12:34:56+0100\" <FT_ABSOLUTE_TIME> -> reg#1\n  (...)\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2021-12-24T14:24:28.000+00:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2021-12-31T15:01:41.000+00:00",
